# RecoveryOS - Phase 1 has no runtime env vars (static site).
# The waitlist access key is a public site key set in assets/app.js (WAITLIST_ACCESS_KEY).
#
# Phase 2 (preview - see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md):
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=        # server only, never shipped to the browser
# TRANSACTIONAL_EMAIL_API_KEY=      # consented provider only
# AI_PROVIDER_API_KEY=              # optional, behind feature flag, token-capped
